model life
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "G10 review probe (invented): a movement before from reads lifespan(k) of a thing the scenario changes"

source card "the reviewer's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind persons: parties

input pay_day: date

input amt: money PLN

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

move pay: transfers
  on pay_day
  when lifespan(ola).to != never
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt + 0 * bal(konto)

ask b0: bal(konto, 2026-06-30)

ask l0: lifespan(ola).to

version card_2026
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ola] lives 1980-01-01..
  pay_day = 2026-02-01 "the card"
  amt = 10.00 PLN "the card"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
